# Flutter kiosk client

Treat `kiosk/` as a **physical terminal** (Advan A10 class, landscape, locked fullscreen), not a pocket mobile app.

- Call Laravel `/api/v1`. Parse DTOs. Do not decide PAID / ISSUED / USED locally
- Local storage is UI/session/idempotency/recovery only — never the ledger
- Idempotency keys on critical writes (order, payment)
- Map API errors honestly: pending, fail, recovery. Never fake success offline
- Print **server** print-payload. Printer failure after PAID → show QR + staff reprint; do not void payment
- Scanner (if any) is input only; Laravel validates and checks in
- Respect device registration, heartbeat, maintenance, and remote disable from the server
- Bahasa Indonesia first; large touch targets
- No secrets hardcoded in source
